WEBVTT

00:04.000 --> 00:07.520
No matter what can't treat the people like this.

00:08.320 --> 00:13.360
Xie Xuan here I order you at all costs.

00:13.960 --> 00:15.320
Take the city tomorrow.

00:15.480 --> 00:16.880
Yes.

00:24.500 --> 00:36.500
Zhu Yuanzhi's surprise raid proved completely victorious, seizing immense spoils and earning supreme merit for revitalizing the entire army's morale.

00:40.360 --> 00:42.040
Oh, quickly relay.

